WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.601
♪ (TRANQUIL MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.569
JOHN WILSON:<i> Hey, New York.</i>

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.104
<i> There's a lot of stuff
 that happened</i>

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:07.340
<i> since the last season
 of the show ended.</i>

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:11.644
<i> You had to spend
a whole lot of time inside</i>

00:00:13.045 --> 00:00:16.716
<i>and got really close with
just a handful of people.</i>

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.420
<i> You got really good
 at cutting your own hair</i>

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:26.326
<i>and discovered exciting new ways
 to entertain yourself.</i>

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:32.098
<i>But you still found a way
to show up for work every day</i>

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:34.767
<i> and treated yourself
 to a vacation</i>

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:36.569
<i> whenever it felt safe.</i>

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:41.374
<i>And just when you thought things
were going back to normal,</i>

00:00:42.341 --> 00:00:45.045
<i> the nightmare
 just seemed to continue.</i>

00:00:47.746 --> 00:00:49.916
<i> A lot of people thought
 that we wouldn't be able</i>

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:52.052
<i> to make another season
 of the show,</i>

00:00:53.253 --> 00:00:54.253
<i> but we did.</i>

00:00:55.054 --> 00:00:57.757
<i> And it still has
 all your favorite stuff</i>

00:00:58.524 --> 00:00:59.426
<i> from the first one.</i>

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.328
<i> New York looks
more interesting right now</i>

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:04.364
<i> than it ever has before.</i>

00:01:05.798 --> 00:01:08.568
<i> And even though you lost
 a lot of what you loved,</i>

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:12.405
<i>it really made you appreciate
 what you still have.</i>

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.042
<i> So, don't be upset
 if you feel like</i>

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:17.877
<i> you missed anything
 along the way</i>

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:22.882
<i>because you don't always realize
you're in the middle of history</i>

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:24.784
<i> until it's over.</i>

00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:27.353
♪ (MUSIC BUILDS) ♪

00:01:56.715 --> 00:01:59.385
<i> This is John Wilson.
 Talk to you soon.</i>

